    answer: "Use Google Play Console store performance to understand how visitors reach a listing, which segments acquire, and where conversion differs. Compare search and explore context, country, language, traffic source, and custom listing where available; then connect acquisitions to crashes, uninstalls, retention, and value. Diagnose a segment before changing the global page.",
